OL,3,GNEWSAMural celebrates nearly 40 years
OL,4,Aof women's centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new mural chronicling the history of
OL,7,Fa women's centre and the community
OL,8,Faround the organisation has been
OL,9,Funveiled.
OL,11,FThe 40ft (12m) artwork celebrating the
OL,12,Fpast of the Tees Valley Women's Centre
OL,13,Fstretches along Upper Albion Street in
OL,14,FSouth Bank near Middlesbrough.
OL,16,FThe centre opened in 1987 with the aim
OL,17,Fof improving the quality of life and
OL,18,Fopportunities for women in the area.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
