OL,3,GNEWSAMural celebrates nearly 40 years
OL,4,Aof women's centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FManager at the Tees Valley Women's
OL,7,FCentre Donna Middleton said the mural
OL,8,Fwas a "wonderful celebration" of the
OL,9,Fthousands of women who had come through
OL,10,Fthe doors over the years.
